 "caption": "Business Banking digital sales and website analytics, Q3 2026, with illustrative test figures: 46% of new business accounts were opened online, 1.5% of 412,000 product page visits ended in an opened account, 51% of started applications were never submitted, and online openings rose every quarter to 6.1k. Illustrative figures, not measurements.",
